{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんにちは〜🐸🥕"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けやき坂46 2期生の 丹生明里です٩( ᐛ )و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1VZ06VH103VKHYVXGWY887","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ひらがな推し」の、名札です📛\nカラフルでとっても可愛らしいです💕"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「欅って書けない？」に初登場した際の名札でもこのように撮ったので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて同じ感じに👍"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今思えばもう17歳なんだ〜、4月から高校3年生か〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思うと、嬉しいようで不安で、複雑な気持ちです…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から新年度！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"四月は多くの人にとっても節目の月になると思うので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心を入れ替えたいですね😌"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"只今、絶賛舞台稽古期間なのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生では納豆食べる人多くて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごはん中に納豆臭が漂ってます 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もつられて食べたくなってきますね😑\n \n(因みに私は対抗してアタリメを食べています🦑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"納豆マスターの松田好花は(今勝手に命名しました 笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"納豆と色んなもので組み合わせて食べてます🤤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"流石納豆上級者！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と宮田愛萌が言ってました〜🗣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は言わないんかーい🙄"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜*〜☆〜†〜☆〜†〜☆〜†〜*〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3/24 に ポートメッセなごやで6枚目シングル初の全国握手会がありました🤝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1VZ18R1F1SE56F44YEWWHR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左から 金村美玖 宮田愛萌 河田陽菜 丹生明里"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"机が一緒だったメンバーで撮りました📸"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひながよくやるポーズをしました〜笑\n(ひなちゃんポーズ！勝手に付けてみた！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもひな自身は恥ずかしがってひらがなポーズ！！\nひながよくやるのに、やらないのね∧( 'Θ' )∧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてミニライブで 二期生の楽曲 \n半分の記憶 を披露したのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてつもなく緊張しました😱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生の色を出せるよう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからももっと良いパフォーマンスができるよう頑張ります💪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、握手会のペアは 影山さんでした！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1VZ2CCW01906BPTXBX1BQF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張って19レーンを表しました 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見えるかなぁ〜🧐"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"影山さんは明るくて優しくて、\nお話ししていてとっても楽しいです♪\n気さくに話しかけてくださるので嬉しくて心臓が飛び跳ねそうです…💗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"影山さんのファンの方も優しくお話ししてくださって嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました🌟"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1VZ3CW66A20P6VEFQ3KCR7","alt":""},{"type":"paragrap